# Not needed for the normal setups:
#   - `bun run dev` rewrites /v1 to http://localhost:3000 (see next.config.ts),
#     so it talks to a locally running API with zero config.
#   - A production build is served by the backend itself (see
#     backend/src/main.rs), so it calls /v1 same-origin.
#
# Set this only if the web client is deployed separately from the API it
# talks to (e.g. this app on a CDN, the API elsewhere). In that case also set
# CORS_ORIGIN on the API to this app's origin, or the session cookies will be
# dropped by the browser.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_COWRI_API_URL=https://api.example.com/v1
